        "original_id": "5c9d40ef-366b-5cde-af3e-8833bcb24dd7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: NBA 2K16, NBA 2K17\n- People: Tony Parker, Dennis Schröder, Marc Gasol, Pau Gasol\n- Companies: Take-Two Interactive, 2K Games, Social Point\n- Organizations: San Antonio Spurs, Atlanta Hawks, Memphis Grizzlies, Chicago Bulls\n- Roles: point guard\n- Concepts: NBA 2K franchise, cover athletes\n\nFacts:\n- NBA 2K16 has regional cover athletes: Tony Parker for the French version, Dennis Schröder for the German version, and Marc and Pau Gasol for the Spanish version.\n- Tony Parker played for the San Antonio Spurs when he was the French cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Dennis Schröder played for the Atlanta Hawks when he was the German cover athlete for NBA 2K16.\n- Marc Gasol and Pau Gasol were the Spanish cover athletes for NBA 2K16, representing the Memphis Grizzlies and Chicago Bulls respectively.\n- Dennis Schröder plays the point guard position.\n- NBA 2K17 is the 18th installment in the NBA 2K franchise and the successor to NBA 2K16.\n- Take-Two Interactive owns 2K Games.\n- Take-Two Interactive publishes 2K Sports titles through 2K Games and creates free-to-play mobile titles through Social Point.",
